        "text": "=You are an HR resume screening assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following resume.\n\nExtract:\n- Candidate name\n- Email\n- Phone\n- Education\n- Skills\n- Experience\n- Projects\n\nThen compare the candidate with this job:\n\nPosition: Python Developer\n\nRequired skills:\n- Python\n- FastAPI\n- SQL\n- REST API\n- Git\n- Docker\n\nGive:\n1. Matching skills\n2. Missing skills\n3. Experience match\n4. Score from 0 to 100\n5. Recommendation: Shortlist or Reject\n\nResume:\n{{ $json.text }}\nReturn the result as JSON.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a helpful assistant\noutput format:\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"Ali Khan\",\n  \"email\": \"ali@gmail.com\",\n  \"score\": 87,\n  \"matching_skills\": [\n    \"Python\",\n    \"FastAPI\",\n    \"SQL\",\n    \"Git\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_skills\": [\n    \"Docker\"\n  ],\n  \"recommendation\": \"Shortlist\"\n}"
        }
